sequenceDiagram
    actor Reader as Reader
    participant Flutter as Flutter App
    participant BiometricModule as Biometric Module
    participant PythonService as Python Face Service
    participant CacheModule as Cache Module
    participant Database as Database

    loop For each required pose (Frontal, Left, Right...)
        Reader->>Flutter: Perform pose in front of camera
        Flutter->>+BiometricModule: POST /biometric/face/process-pose (image, expectedPose)
        BiometricModule->>+PythonService: gRPC: CheckPose & ExtractEmbedding(image, expectedPose)

        alt Pose invalid / Spoof
            PythonService-->>BiometricModule: Error (InvalidPose / Spoof)
            BiometricModule-->>Flutter: 400 Bad Request
            Flutter-->>Reader: Prompt adjust pose & retry
        else Pose valid
            PythonService-->>-BiometricModule: FaceEmbedding
            BiometricModule->>+CacheModule: rpush(sessionKey, embedding)
            CacheModule-->>-BiometricModule: OK
            BiometricModule-->>-Flutter: 200 OK (PoseAccepted)
            Flutter-->>Reader: Guide next pose
        end
    end

    Reader->>Flutter: Finish all poses
    Flutter->>+BiometricModule: POST /biometric/face/complete-registration (sessionId)
    BiometricModule->>+CacheModule: lrange(sessionKey)
    CacheModule-->>-BiometricModule: listEmbeddings
    Note over BiometricModule: Calculate average vector (mean embedding)
    BiometricModule->>+Database: saveBiometricProfile(userId, meanEmbedding)
    Database-->>-BiometricModule: OK
    BiometricModule->>+CacheModule: del(sessionKey)
    CacheModule-->>-BiometricModule: OK
    BiometricModule-->>-Flutter: 201 Created (RegistrationSuccess)
    Flutter-->>Reader: Registration completed

